cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and this code archive."
type: software
title: "FIU-SharkFishCoral-FrenchPoly: Analysis code for top-down and bottom-up forcing on French Polynesian coral reefs"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-04-27"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.19835080"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.19835080"
    description: "Zenodo archive of v1.0.0 (this release)"
abstract: >-
  R analysis pipeline for the manuscript "Top-down and bottom-up forcing on coral reefs
  changes with habitat-specific predator abundance" (Dedman et al. 2026). Provides
  scripts to reproduce all figures and statistical results: data preparation from
  benthic UVC and BRUV surveys; boosted regression tree (BRT) models of fish biomass
  and benthic cover; structural causal modelling using Bayesian regression (brms)
  with cubic shrinkage splines; directed acyclic graph (DAG) consistency testing
  and visualisation. Tested on R 4.3+; package versions pinned via renv.
